  - id: 5835
    name: "T\xF2a C3B"
    description: "T\xF2a C3B l\xE0 m\u1ED9t trong hai t\xF2a nh\xE0 thu\u1ED9c Trung
      t\xE2m Kh\u1EA3o th\xED Ngo\u1EA1i ng\u1EEF v\xE0 Trao \u0111\u1ED5i v\u0103n
      h\xF3a (CLC) - \u0111\u01A1n v\u1ECB d\u1ECBch v\u1EE5 tr\u1EF1c thu\u1ED9c
      \u0110\u1EA1i h\u1ECDc B\xE1ch khoa H\xE0 N\u1ED9i. \u0110\xE2y l\xE0 \u0111\u1ECBa
      \u0111i\u1EC3m th\u01B0\u1EDDng xuy\xEAn t\u1ED5 ch\u1EE9c c\xE1c k\u1EF3 thi
      ngo\u1EA1i ng\u1EEF qu\u1ED1c t\u1EBF (TOEIC, VSTEP...) v\xE0 c\xE1c l\u1EDBp
      h\u1ECDc ti\u1EBFng Anh, ti\u1EBFng Trung, ti\u1EBFng H\xE0n, ti\u1EBFng \u0110\u1EE9c
      cho sinh vi\xEAn v\xE0 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi h\u1ECDc b\xEAn ngo\xE0i."
