  - id: 5134
    name: "T\xF2a D8"
    description: "T\xF2a D8 l\xE0 c\xF4ng tr\xECnh hi\u1EC7n \u0111\u1EA1i cao 11
      t\u1EA7ng n\u1ED5i v\xE0 1 t\u1EA7ng h\u1EA7m. Trong \u0111\xF3 t\u1EA7ng 1
      - 5 bao g\u1ED3m 30 ph\xF2ng h\u1ECDc hi\u1EC7n \u0111\u1EA1i ph\u1EE5c v\u1EE5
