  - id: 1399
    name: "C\u0103ng tin D2A"
    description: "T\xF2a nh\xE0 D2A t\u1EA1i \u0110\u1EA1i h\u1ECDc B\xE1ch khoa
      H\xE0 N\u1ED9i l\xE0 n\u01A1i \u0111\u1EB7t tr\u1EE5 s\u1EDF c\u1EE7a Trung
      t\xE2m Khoa h\u1ECDc & C\xF4ng ngh\u1EC7 Cao su (CEBER). Ngo\xE0i ch\u1EE9c
      n\u0103ng nghi\xEAn c\u1EE9u chuy\xEAn ng\xE0nh, t\xF2a nh\xE0 c\xF2n l\xE0
      \u0111\u1ECBa \u0111i\u1EC3m ph\u1EE5c v\u1EE5 \u0111\u1EDDi s\u1ED1ng c\xE1n
      b\u1ED9 v\xE0 sinh vi\xEAn v\u1EDBi canteen ho\u1EA1t \u0111\u1ED9ng t\u1EEB
      7h \u0111\u1EBFn 20h h\xE0ng ng\xE0y, v\xE0 nh\xE0 \u0103n d\xE0nh ri\xEAng
      cho c\xE1n b\u1ED9 vi\xEAn ch\u1EE9c \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c khai tr\u01B0\u01A1ng
      v\xE0o th\xE1ng 9/2016 t\u1EA1i t\u1EA7ng 3, ph\u1EE5c v\u1EE5 \u0103n s\xE1ng,
      tr\u01B0a v\xE0 t\u1ED1i."
