  - id: 9138
    name: PTN Polime
    description: "Ph\xF2ng th\xED nghi\u1EC7m Tr\u1ECDng \u0111i\u1EC3m Qu\u1ED1c
      gia v\u1EC1 V\u1EADt li\u1EC7u Polyme v\xE0 Compozit thu\u1ED9c \u0110\u1EA1i
      h\u1ECDc B\xE1ch khoa H\xE0 N\u1ED9i, g\u1EAFn v\u1EDBi chuy\xEAn ng\xE0nh
      C\xF4ng ngh\u1EC7 V\u1EADt li\u1EC7u Polyme v\xE0 Compozit (Tr\u01B0\u1EDDng
      V\u1EADt li\u1EC7u). 100% sinh vi\xEAn ng\xE0nh n\xE0y \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng trang thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB c\u1EE7a Ph\xF2ng th\xED nghi\u1EC7m
      Tr\u1ECDng \u0111i\u1EC3m qu\u1ED1c gia v\u1EC1 V\u1EADt li\u1EC7u Polyme v\xE0
      Compozit, c\u0169ng nh\u01B0 c\xE1c ph\xF2ng th\xED nghi\u1EC7m hi\u1EC7n \u0111\u1EA1i
      v\u1EC1 v\u1EADt li\u1EC7u c\u1EE7a \u0110HBK H\xE0 N\u1ED9i."
