  - id: 9242
    name: "H\u1ED3 Ti\u1EC1n"
    description: "H\u1ED3 Ti\u1EC1n l\xE0 h\u1ED3 n\u01B0\u1EDBc duy nh\u1EA5t trong
      khu\xF4n vi\xEAn \u0110\u1EA1i h\u1ECDc B\xE1ch khoa H\xE0 N\u1ED9i, n\u1EB1m
      s\xE1t c\u1EA1nh Th\u01B0 vi\u1EC7n T\u1EA1 Quang B\u1EEDu v\xE0 t\xF2a nh\xE0
      Alumni. V\u1EC1 t\xEAn g\u1ECDi, c\xF3 th\xF4ng tin cho r\u1EB1ng h\u1ED3 c\xF3
      t\xEAn \"Ti\u1EC1n\" v\xEC n\xF3 n\u1EB1m \u1EDF ph\xEDa tr\u01B0\u1EDBc m\u1ED9t
      h\u1ED3 kh\xE1c g\u1ECDi l\xE0 H\u1ED3 H\u1EADu - tuy nhi\xEAn H\u1ED3 H\u1EADu
      v\u1EC1 sau \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECB l\u1EA5p \u0111i, ch\u1EC9 c\xF2n l\u1EA1i H\u1ED3
      Ti\u1EC1n t\u1ED3n t\u1EA1i \u0111\u1EBFn ng\xE0y nay."
