  - id: 3702
    name: TTVD
    description: "T\xF2a nh\xE0 VDZ (D2C) l\xE0 tr\u1EE5 s\u1EDF c\u1EE7a Trung t\xE2m
      Vi\u1EC7t-\u0110\u1EE9c, \u0111\u01A1n v\u1ECB h\u1ED7 tr\u1EE3 trao \u0111\u1ED5i,
      h\u1EE3p t\xE1c \u0111\xE0o t\u1EA1o v\xE0 nghi\xEAn c\u1EE9u khoa h\u1ECDc
      song ph\u01B0\u01A1ng gi\u1EEFa Vi\u1EC7t Nam v\xE0 CHLB \u0110\u1EE9c. Trung
      t\xE2m c\u0169ng l\xE0 tr\u1EE5 s\u1EDF c\u1EE7a V\u0103n ph\xF2ng \u0111\u1EA1i
      di\u1EC7n C\u01A1 quan trao \u0111\u1ED5i h\xE0n l\xE2m \u0110\u1EE9c t\u1EA1i
      Vi\u1EC7t Nam, L\xE0o, Campuchia v\xE0 Myanmar, th\u01B0\u1EDDng xuy\xEAn t\u1ED5
      ch\u1EE9c c\xE1c kh\xF3a h\u1ECDc ti\u1EBFng \u0110\u1EE9c t\u1EEB A1 \u0111\u1EBFn
      B2 cho sinh vi\xEAn v\xE0 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi h\u1ECDc b\xEAn ngo\xE0i. C\u01A1
      s\u1EDF v\u1EADt ch\u1EA5t g\u1ED3m c\xE1c ph\xF2ng l\xE0m vi\u1EC7c, ph\xF2ng
      h\u1ECDp, ph\xF2ng h\u1ED9i th\u1EA3o s\u1EE9c ch\u1EE9a t\u1EEB 50 \u0111\u1EBFn
      200 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi, \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c trang b\u1ECB \u0111\u1EA7y \u0111\u1EE7
      thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB ph\u1EE5c v\u1EE5 h\u1ED9i ngh\u1ECB, h\u1ED9i th\u1EA3o
      trong n\u01B0\u1EDBc v\xE0 qu\u1ED1c t\u1EBF."
    thumb: {fileID: 2800000, guid: e09bdda50ffde0940b85c89af2d2b990, type: 3}
    gridWidth: 8
    gridHeight: 2
    arrowOffsetX: 0
    arrowOffsetZ: 0
