  - id: 4073
    name: "T\xF2a ICEA"
    description: "T\xF2a nh\xE0 ICEA l\xE0 tr\u1EE5 s\u1EDF c\u1EE7a Vi\u1EC7n C\xF4ng
      ngh\u1EC7 \u0110i\u1EC1u khi\u1EC3n v\xE0 T\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng h\xF3a. Vi\u1EC7n
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c h\xECnh th\xE0nh tr\xEAn c\u01A1 s\u1EDF \u0111i\u1EC1u
      ch\u1EC9nh t\xEAn g\u1ECDi v\xE0 t\xE1i c\u01A1 c\u1EA5u t\u1EEB Vi\u1EC7n
      K\u1EF9 thu\u1EADt \u0110i\u1EC1u khi\u1EC3n v\xE0 T\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng h\xF3a
      trong qu\xE1 tr\xECnh chuy\u1EC3n \u0111\u1ED5i m\xF4 h\xECnh c\u1EE7a nh\xE0
      tr\u01B0\u1EDDng. T\xF2a nh\xE0 bao g\u1ED3m c\xE1c ph\xF2ng th\xED nghi\u1EC7m
      nghi\xEAn c\u1EE9u chuy\xEAn s\xE2u, v\u0103n ph\xF2ng vi\u1EC7n, trung t\xE2m
      m\xE1y t\xEDnh v\xE0 x\u01B0\u1EDFng th\u1EED nghi\u1EC7m - s\u1EA3n xu\u1EA5t."
